{"articleNo":"373473","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=373473&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"체육대회참가자 공결 처리 완료 안내(본인확인 필수)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.03","hit":"11104","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">대동제 체육대회 예선 참가로&nbsp;인한 공결신청이 모두 승인 완료되어 안내드립니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">1차요청분 5월 24일에 승인완료 ,</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">2차요청분 6월 3일에 승인완료되었습니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">완료된 대상자에게는 해당 일에 금오톡톡 안내하였으므로 톡톡 알림을 받은 학생들은 본인의 승인내역을 확인바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">공결승인 내역은 원스톱서비스 공결신청내역에서 즉시 확인가능하나,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">전자출결 출석부에는 내일(6월4일)에 반영됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">기말시험과 종강일이 다가오므로 본인의 공결 및 출석 내역을 필히 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">체육대회 관련 공결이 신청 누락되었거나, 내역에 이상이 있을 경우</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">학생성공처 054-478-7040로 문의바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">감사합니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-all; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><br style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\